"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">默认就是 pre-wrap'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"line-number\">15</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre>"
